Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:15:50 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/22] Build the System Settings tree from the layout

Groups, categories and pages come from settingslayout_p.h in layout order.
Pages the layout does not list are placed through its fallback table, so
none disappears. Info Center pages become search-only Technical Details.

